{
  "id": "24-k1-removed-beacon-signal",
  "description": "k1 DID; update 1 removes the #initialP2PKH beacon service (version 2); update 2 is announced at the removed #initialP2PKH address and adds a service. A resolver ignores the signal of a beacon address that the current document does not carry (Process Next Update, step 4): resolves to version 2, and version 3 does not exist.",
  "network": "mutinynet",
  "idType": "KEY",
